      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "躺在床上时菱钻奇宝发现了，\n至今为止自己觉悟不够的部分，\n都是用训练员的觉悟来弥补。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b8e2b9611dcbe5d86b149cbfcac53bc3b82a67c54edddb458ed2c461b7e2ed7",
