      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一如往常，菱钻奇宝充满干劲地将自己逼到极限，\n最终导致自己过度劳累。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e49c67923b444981d68f32e69a7928542da45faaa56fd3bafb70b09ff68e0b47",
