      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“要是展现出全力后，发现自己能力不足，\n是不是就会被抛弃？”她抱持着这样的恐惧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6463a9b8f64d3c469adefda54b78b73debd8ea7c39c52779c3b7c82cf0ca9005",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
